==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|whatever}}. {{surf|en|what|ever}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ʍɒtˈɛvə/|/wɒtˈɛvə/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/wʌtˈɛvɚ/|[wəɾˈɛvɚ]|a=GA}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-whatever.ogg|a=GA}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɛvə(ɹ)|s=3}}

The {{IPAchar|/t/}} in {{m|en|whatever}} may be [[w:Flapping|flapped]] in certain dialects, despite the fact that it precedes a stressed vowel, due to the morpheme boundary between {{m|en|what}} and {{m|en|ever}}.

===Determiner===
{{en-det}}

# {{lb|en|interrogative}} [[what|What]] [[ever]]; {{n-g|emphatic form of 'what'.}}
#: {{ux|en|Good heavens! '''Whatever''' time is it?!}}
# [[regardless of|Regardless of]] the ... that; for any ... that. <!-- Appears to be a kind of fusion of a preposition and a determiner with embedded relative pronoun to boot. Is there a term for this? -->
#: {{ux|en|'''Whatever''' your choice, there will be consequences.}}
#: {{ux|en|I will stick with you, '''whatever''' fate befalls us.}}
# [[any|Any]] ... that; of no matter what type or kind that.
#: {{ux|en|'''Whatever''' doubts I had were quickly dispelled.}}
#: {{ux|en|Write down '''whatever''' thoughts come into your mind.}}
#* {{RQ:Tennyson In Memoriam|XVII|28|So may '''whatever''' tempest mars<br>⁠Mid-ocean, spare thee, sacred bark;<br>⁠And balmy drops in summer dark<br>Slide from the bosom of the stars.}}
#* {{RQ:Schuster Hepaticae|volume=V|page=viii|text='''Whatever''' utility the work may have outside of its stated boundaries will be largely because of such a nonprovincial approach.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1997| title=Whatever Happened to the Soul?: |author=Warren S. Brown; Nancey C. Murphy; H. Newton Malony | page=115| passage=In an expression that reflects the pathos of a person without memory of a recent past, Milner quotes H.M. as saying, "Every day is alone in itself, '''whatever''' enjoyment I've had, and '''whatever''' sorrow I've had Right now, I'm wondering. Have I done or said anything amiss? That's what worries me. It's like waking from a dream; I just don't remember."}}
# [[any|Any]]; of no matter what type or kind.
#: {{ux|en|He must be stopped, '''whatever''' the cost.
}}

