===Pronoun===
{{en-pron}}

# {{lb|en|interrogative}} [[what|What]] [[ever]]; {{n-g|emphasised form of 'what', used to ask which thing, event, circumstance, etc.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Whatever''' do you mean?}}
#* {{quote-song|en|year=1977|author=w:Hugh Cornwell; w:Jean-Jacques Burnel; w:Jet Black|title={{w|No More Heroes (The Stranglers song)|No More Heroes}}|artist=w:The Stranglers|album={{w|No More Heroes (album)|No More Heroes}}|passage='''Whatever''' happened to Leon Trotsky?<br>He got an ice pick<br>That made his ears burn}}
# [[regardless of|Regardless of]] anything that. <!-- Appears to be a kind of fusion of preposition and pronoun, with embedded relative pronoun to boot. Is there a term for this? -->
#: {{ux|en|'''Whatever''' he does, he will still lose the game.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Whatever''' happens, stay calm.}}
# {{lb|en|fused relative}} [[anything|Anything]] that; [[all]] that.
#: {{ux|en|Do '''whatever''' works.}}
#: {{ux|en|I’ll do '''whatever''' I can.}}
#* {{RQ:Pope Essay on Man|epistle=I|page=16|lines=280–281|passage=And ſpight of Pride, and in thy Reaſon's ſpight, / One truth is clear; "'''Whatever''' Is, is {{smallcaps|Right}}."}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=w:Henry Petroski|title=The Evolution of Eyeglasses|url=http://www.americanscientist.org/issues/pub/2013/5/the-evolution-of-eyeglasses|magazine=w:American Scientist|month=September-October|year=2013|passage=The ability of a segment of a glass sphere to magnify '''whatever''' is placed before it was known around the year 1000, when the spherical segment was called a reading stone, essentially what today we might term a frameless magnifying glass or plain glass paperweight.}}
# {{lb|en|informal}} [[anything|Anything]]; thing(s) of unspecified kind, or no matter what kind; {{non-gloss|sometimes used to indicate that the speaker does not care about options}}.
#: {{ux|en|I don't need any of this stuff, so take '''whatever'''.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2021| title=Whatever the Cost|author=Michael Kurland | page=| passage=There's a pile of stuff on that table; clippings, pamphlets, posters, '''whatever''', that needs to be sorted and filed.}}

